></div></div><!----><!----></div><div style="grid-column: 4 / span 1;"><div class="uikit-typography-headline-medium desktop:h-[34rem] desktop:p-14 bg-uikit-surfaces-base-subtle group/card relative flex h-[24rem] flex-col justify-between whitespace-pre-line p-6"><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-primary"> The 1inch API made it effortless for us to expand our product across multiple chains without dealing with complex rewrites. It has saved our team significant time and resources. </p><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-primary">  </p><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-secondary uikit-typography-headline-medium"><!----> Birdeye </p></div></div><!----><!----></div><div style="grid-column: 5 / span 1;"><div class="uikit-typography-headline-medium desktop:h-[34rem] desktop:p-14 bg-uikit-surfaces-base-subtle group/card relative flex h-[24rem] flex-col justify-between whitespace-pre-line p-6"><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-primary"> With 1inch APIs, Trust Wallet can provide users faster, more reliable swaps while reducing the complexity on our engineering side. It’s a powerful solution that helps us scale with confidence. </p><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-primary">  </p><p class="text-uikit-typography-base-secondary uikit-typography-headline-medium"><!----> Trust Wallet </p></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----></div><button class="absolute left-0 top-0 z-50 flex h-full flex-wrap content-center justify-center p-2 text-white opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 hover:opacity-100 disabled:opacity-0 disabled:hover:opacity-100 opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed" disabled="" jsaction="click:;"><uikit-internal-icon role="img" class="-rotate-90 rounded-full bg-black bg-opacity-50 p-4" style="--icon-src: url('/assets/icons/chevron_24.svg');" ngh="1"></uikit-internal-icon></button><button class="absolute right-0 top-0 z-50 flex h-full flex-wrap content-center justify-center p-2 text-white opacity-0 transition-all